164
00:10:58.030 --> 00:11:01.950
Sellisel juhul teeme kohe terveks.

165
00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:03.840
Kuule, Maret.

166
00:11:03.940 --> 00:11:06.690
Mul kurk valutab.

167
00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:09.870
Kuule, sul on ju palavik?
Sind peab jalamaid kraadima,

168
00:11:09.970 --> 00:11:13.470
